OL,3,AManhunt after boy's sword injury
OL,4,Asparked lockdowns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are hunting for two suspects,
OL,7,Fone of whom is believed to have been
OL,8,Fcarrying a sword, following an
OL,9,Faltercation that left a teenager
OL,10,Finjured.
OL,12,FArmed police were called to the
OL,13,Fincident near St Peter's High School in
OL,14,FGloucester earlier. The school and
OL,15,FWillow Primary Academy were put into
OL,16,Flockdown while officers searched for
OL,17,Fthe group who had fled the scene.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
