OL,3,AMan, 41, and boy, 16, arrested after
OL,4,Acar damaged by gunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after
OL,7,Farmed police responded to an incident
OL,8,Fin which a car was hit by gunshots.
OL,10,FSouth Wales Police said a vehicle on
OL,11,Fthe A48 in Morriston, Swansea,
OL,12,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,13,Ffirearms discharge" on Friday and one
OL,14,Fperson has sustained minor injuries.
OL,16,FA 41-year-old man from Llansamlet,
OL,17,FSwansea, arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fpossessing a firearm with intent to
OL,19,Fendanger life and a 16-year-old boy,
OL,20,Falso from Llansamlet, arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of affray, remain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
