OL,3,AEarly results suggest Labour ahead of
OL,4,ANational in New Zealand election with
OL,5,Avotes still being counted
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlthough results have started coming in
OL,8,Falready, they will not be official
OL,9,Funtil later this month
OL,11,FDue to a quirk of New Zealand's
OL,12,Fpolitical system called the "overhang",
OL,13,Fwe may see the country's biggest ever
OL,14,Fparliament this election
OL,16,FIf results are close, negotiations
OL,17,Fcould take some time - in 2023,
OL,18,Fnegotiations took 41 days
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
